{"title":"Git 其他操作","date":"2024-10-04T16:00:00.000Z","toc":false,"summary":"","source":"_posts/软件测试/工具流/Git/Git_其他.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Git 其他操作\ntags: [Git, 工具相关]\nsummary: \"\"\ntoc: false\ncopyright: \"\"\ndate: 2024-10-05\n---\n\n## 其他操作\n\n### 常用忽略文件\n\n<https://github.com/seeways/MyIgnore>\n\n### 配置别名\n\n```bash\ngit config --global alias.<name> <git-name>\n```\n\n建议熟悉git命令后使用\n\n```bash\n# 设置别名\ngit config --global alias.unstage 'reset HEAD'\n\n# 使用别名撤掉修改,实际执行git reset HEAD test.py\ngit unstage test.py\n```\n\n对长命令的别名尤其好用\ngit config --global alias.lg \"log --color --graph --pretty=format:'%Cred%h%Creset -%C(yellow)%d%Creset %s %Cgreen(%cr) %C(bold blue)<%an>%Creset' --abbrev-commit\"\n\n使用效果git lg\n\n![git-lg](https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/AlwaysYo/TyporaPics/Assets/20250525172649376.png)\n\n### 显示颜色\n\n如果没有默认显示变更文件的颜色，推荐此选项\n\n```bash\ngit config --global color.ui true\n```\n\n### git config\n\n1. 配置Git的时候，加上--global是针对当前用户起作用的，如果不加，那只针对当前的仓库起作用。\n2. 仓库的Git配置文件都在仓库.git/config文件中\n3. 全局的Git配置文件放在用户主目录下的.gitconfig中(隐藏文件)\n4. 如果想修改配置或者别名，直接修改或删掉即可\n","slug":"软件测试/工具流/Git/Git_其他","published":true,"updated":"2024-10-04T16:00:00.000Z","_id":"cmcg7o5xr002bprqbdp8w3qih","comments":true,"layout":"post","photos":[],"html":"<h2 id=\"其他操作\"><a href=\"#其他操作\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"其他操作\"></a>其他操作</h2><h3 id=\"常用忽略文件\"><a href=\"#常用忽略文件\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"常用忽略文件\"></a>常用忽略文件</h3><p><a href=\"https://github.com/seeways/MyIgnore\">https://github.com/seeways/MyIgnore</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"配置别名\"><a href=\"#配置别名\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"配置别名\"></a>配置别名</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git config --global <span class=\"built_in\">alias</span>.&lt;name&gt; &lt;git-name&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>建议熟悉git命令后使用</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 设置别名</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">git config --global alias.unstage <span class=\"string\">&#x27;reset HEAD&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用别名撤掉修改,实际执行git reset HEAD test.py</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">git unstage test.py</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>对长命令的别名尤其好用<br>git config –global alias.lg “log –color –graph –pretty&#x3D;format:’%Cred%h%Creset -%C(yellow)%d%Creset %s %Cgreen(%cr) %C(bold blue)&lt;%an&gt;%Creset’ –abbrev-commit”</p>\n<p>使用效果git lg</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/AlwaysYo/TyporaPics/Assets/20250525172649376.png\" alt=\"git-lg\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"显示颜色\"><a href=\"#显示颜色\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"显示颜色\"></a>显示颜色</h3><p>如果没有默认显示变更文件的颜色，推荐此选项</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git config --global color.ui <span class=\"literal\">true</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"git-config\"><a href=\"#git-config\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"git config\"></a>git config</h3><ol>\n<li>配置Git的时候，加上–global是针对当前用户起作用的，如果不加，那只针对当前的仓库起作用。</li>\n<li>仓库的Git配置文件都在仓库.git&#x2F;config文件中</li>\n<li>全局的Git配置文件放在用户主目录下的.gitconfig中(隐藏文件)</li>\n<li>如果想修改配置或者别名，直接修改或删掉即可</li>\n</ol>\n","excerpt":"","more":"<h2 id=\"其他操作\"><a href=\"#其他操作\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"其他操作\"></a>其他操作</h2><h3 id=\"常用忽略文件\"><a href=\"#常用忽略文件\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"常用忽略文件\"></a>常用忽略文件</h3><p><a href=\"https://github.com/seeways/MyIgnore\">https://github.com/seeways/MyIgnore</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"配置别名\"><a href=\"#配置别名\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"配置别名\"></a>配置别名</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git config --global <span class=\"built_in\">alias</span>.&lt;name&gt; &lt;git-name&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>建议熟悉git命令后使用</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 设置别名</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">git config --global alias.unstage <span class=\"string\">&#x27;reset HEAD&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用别名撤掉修改,实际执行git reset HEAD test.py</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">git unstage test.py</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>对长命令的别名尤其好用<br>git config –global alias.lg “log –color –graph –pretty&#x3D;format:’%Cred%h%Creset -%C(yellow)%d%Creset %s %Cgreen(%cr) %C(bold blue)&lt;%an&gt;%Creset’ –abbrev-commit”</p>\n<p>使用效果git lg</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/AlwaysYo/TyporaPics/Assets/20250525172649376.png\" alt=\"git-lg\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"显示颜色\"><a href=\"#显示颜色\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"显示颜色\"></a>显示颜色</h3><p>如果没有默认显示变更文件的颜色，推荐此选项</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git config --global color.ui <span class=\"literal\">true</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"git-config\"><a href=\"#git-config\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"git config\"></a>git config</h3><ol>\n<li>配置Git的时候，加上–global是针对当前用户起作用的，如果不加，那只针对当前的仓库起作用。</li>\n<li>仓库的Git配置文件都在仓库.git&#x2F;config文件中</li>\n<li>全局的Git配置文件放在用户主目录下的.gitconfig中(隐藏文件)</li>\n<li>如果想修改配置或者别名，直接修改或删掉即可</li>\n</ol>\n","path":"2024/10/软件测试/工具流/Git/Git_其他/","permalink":"http://example.com/2024/10/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E6%B5%81/Git/Git_%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96/","tags":[{"name":"工具相关","_id":"cmcg7o5xe001gprqbe22f53hg","slug":"工具相关","path":"tags/工具相关/","permalink":"http://example.com/tags/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3/","length":17},{"name":"Git","_id":"cmcg7o5ys005jprqbf0138qp9","slug":"Git","path":"tags/Git/","permalink":"http://example.com/tags/Git/","length":8}],"categories":[],"prev":{"title":"Git 远程仓库","date":"2024-10-07T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"","slug":"软件测试/工具流/Git/Git_远程仓库","published":true,"updated":"2024-10-07T16:00:00.000Z","_id":"cmcg7o5yw0067prqbbu8dd5fe","layout":"post","photos":[],"excerpt":"","path":"2024/10/软件测试/工具流/Git/Git_远程仓库/","permalink":"http://example.com/2024/10/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E6%B5%81/Git/Git_%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%93%E5%BA%93/","__post":true},"next":{"title":"Git 日志","date":"2024-10-04T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"","slug":"软件测试/工具流/Git/Git_日志","published":true,"updated":"2024-10-04T16:00:00.000Z","_id":"cmcg7o5xt002hprqb2oyc3hlf","layout":"post","photos":[],"excerpt":"","path":"2024/10/软件测试/工具流/Git/Git_日志/","permalink":"http://example.com/2024/10/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E6%B5%81/Git/Git_%E6%97%A5%E5%BF%97/","__post":true},"__post":true}